# Copy this file to `.env.local` (gitignored) and fill in your GIPHY REST "API" key.
# NOTE: the `VITE_` prefix is a Vite convention (exposes a var to the browser bundle).
# We deliberately DO NOT use it: the key is read server-side by the Vite dev proxy
# (see vite.config.ts) and never shipped to the client. GIPHY's dashboard gives an
# "API" key (used here) and an "SDK" key (unused).
GIPHY_API_KEY=
